# ECMP — Anti-Skip Phase Guardrail

User meminta **selalu diingatkan** jika pekerjaan meloncat-loncat atau melewatkan prasyarat.

## Identitas (jangan salah bingkai)

ECMP = **modul bisnis tambahan** di Enterprise Platform (ADR-014). Mode A = hedge delivery. Mode B = embed/SSO ke app utama — **CLOSED** sampai Board unlock.

Lihat juga: `.cursor/rules/ecmp-module-boundary.mdc` (anti-ulang + boundary modul).

## Jalur benar Mode B (jangan loncat)

Governance / kontrak → baru Mode B runtime:

1. ADR-014 + ADR-015 Accepted with Conditions (BOARD-004) — **sudah**
2. ADR-016/017/018 Accepted with Conditions (BOARD-006) — **sudah** (arsitektur; ≠ unlock coding)
3. Org-gap prerequisite evidence (C-B6-3) + bilateral EP obligations
4. **Baru** Board Resolution membuka Mode B coding (Identity Adapter / OpenAPI enterprise `securitySchemes` / SSO UI)
5. Baru OD-FE-002 browser bridge sebagai track implementasi terbuka

Jalur **paralel** Mode A (boleh jalan sendiri, bukan pengganti Mode B):

- Delivery Mode A dalam **AUTHORIZED WITH CONDITIONS** (BR-008)
- OD-FE-001 / stack FE (ADR-013 remain active per BR-007; DEC-019 = `frontend/`)
- Complaint dual-SoT (DEC-020) — no forced merge / no silent foundation cutover

## Anggap meloncat — wajib ingatkan user

- Coding Mode B / SSO / Identity Adapter / enterprise `securitySchemes` sementara C-B6-1 CLOSED
- Menganggap Accept ADR-016/017/018 = Mode B unlocked
- Menganggap FE-ARCH/FE-STD BASELINE = Mode B production AuthN
- Supersede ADR-013 lewat dokumen FE saja (dilarang BR-007)
- Force-merge / retire `/api/v1/complaints` tanpa Retirement DEC
- Invent acceptance ADR atau mengubah Board decision
- Mengulang M1–M5 Mode A yang sudah hijau tanpa gap regresi baru

## Saat mengingatkan

Jelaskan singkat: **apa yang dilompati**, **fase yang benar berikutnya**, **risiko jika dilanjutkan**. Jangan diam-diam ikut loncat.

## Konteks program (ringkas)

- BOARD-004: ADR-014/015 Accepted with Conditions; C-7 Mode B CLOSED
- BOARD-006: ADR-016/017/018 Accepted with Conditions; C-B6-1…7; Mode B tetap CLOSED
- Implementation Authorization: AUTHORIZED WITH CONDITIONS (Mode A)
- Org-gap tetap prasyarat unlock Mode B (C-B6-3)
